<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50 py-12">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
        About North Lakhimpur University
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">
        Established in 1952 
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          North Lakhimpur College (Autonomous), established in 1952, has
          successfully carved its niche in arena of higher education in Assam.
          Committed to raising standards of higher education, college intends to
          equip learners with sound theoretical knowledge, adequate practical
          exposure and develop in them capacity to think. Probably it is
          recognition of such efforts that college was awarded prestigious 'A'
          grade by National Assessment and Accreditation Council (NAAC).
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The founders aspired to enhance socio-cultural development of various
          ethnic groups, create scientific temperament, enhance employability of
          students and promote gender equality. Immensely concerned about
          welfare as well as intellectual and ethical development of students,
          institution provides value education, coaching and remedial classes
          besides establishing forums for community development and extension
          activities, establishing Equal Opportunity Centre, Women's Studies
          Centre etc. The college is committed to raising standards of higher
          education in this part of North Eastern India and for us, offering
          high quality teaching is more than just a priority- it is our raison
          d'etre.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The University Grants Commission was also conferred status of College
          with Potential for Excellence (CPE) to college in 2010 for a period of
          5 years, further extended up to 2019. We are also first autonomous
          college of the state.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
        Innovation & Technology
      </h2>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          North Lakhimpur College has proved to have strategy to percolate
          positive outcome of innovations in teaching with an interdisciplinary
          approach. The gradual reform has made college holistically efficient
          and credible both at the academic and administrative level. The
          learning is made student-centered by participatory learning activities
          through laboratory work; computer aided learning programmes, audio
          visual aids, project and field works, training programmes and study
          tours.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          To further usages of information technology among students, college
          has established two state of art Computer and Networking Centres with
          50 internet browsing terminals besides encouraging use of ICT tools in
          teaching learning process. The campus have wifi connectivity. A state
          of art language laboratory is also there. The thrust area identified
          in consonance with CPE guidelines is to affect a paradigm shift in
          knowledge delivery system. We visualize, in the immediate future, a
          smooth transition to digital learning without sacrificing strengths of
          conventional class room.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
        Infrastructure & Facilities
      </h2>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The college has a main campus with a total area of 25 acres of land
          with compound wall all around and good infrastructure facilities for
          academic, administrative and co curricular activities which include,
          adequate number of class rooms, well-equipped laboratories, library
          and reading room, administrative block, botanical garden, playground,
          gymnasium hall, canteen and parking facilities. The Arts Building is
          being extended to meet demands of students.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The college library and computer facilities are easily accessible to
          students and faculty members. The college library has adequate space
          with reading room facility for students and faculty, issue counter,
          stack room and bound volume room. Facilities like touch screen
          computer, visual book display presenter, photocopier, scanner etc are
          available in library. A retail outlet selling student related
          materials and books is also functional. The college playground has
          been given a face lift and an indoor stadium is there in place for
          sportsmen.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
        Student Welfare & Development
      </h2>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The college strongly believes that its primary stake holders are
          students. It also understands geographic, socio-demographic, economic
          and educational background of people of this region. The college
          intends to provide quality education to all keeping in view
          intelligence and economic status of students. Whereas special remedial
          classes are organized for academically poor students, economically
          vulnerable but meritorious students are provided free admission and
          other in-house scholarships.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          North Lakhimpur College strictly adheres to basic directives of U.G.C.
          for providing equal educational opportunities to differently-able
          persons. To boost morale of students, institution itself offers
          various scholarships and awards to recognize meritorious achievements
          of students in different fields apart from scholarships received by
          students from central and state government as per government rules.
          The college also maintains a 'Student Aid Fund'. A Career and
          Counseling Cell has been established for offering free career
          counseling to students and also for guiding young minds to understand
          their strength by providing them with requisite know how of emerging
          trends in different fields.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">
        Our Vision & Mission
      </h2>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The authority is leaving no stone unturned to guarantee that College
          improvise the existing infrastructure so that it can keep pace with
          global trends whether it be in the field of research work or to
          enhance the quality of teaching-learning process. Congenial academic
          atmosphere in a pollution free campus, introduction of innovative,
          self financing and industrial courses, ICT enabled teaching - learning
          practices, adequate infrastructure, library and other resources, good
          hostel facilities for both boys' and girls', good teachers' quality,
          transparent admission and enforcement of reservations, good results
          and progression are some of the key factors that attract students and
          stakeholders to North Lakhimpur College.
        </p>

        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          A sound academic environment is institution's goal which aptly
          complements its motto - "Let noble thoughts come from all directions"
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
